Package: snipcli
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Chowdhury Rifat Ahmed <67093774+chowdhuryrifat@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libstdc++6 (>= 10)
Description: High-performance algorithmic snippet manager CLI
 SnipCLI is a lightweight, zero-dependency command-line code snippet manager
 built in modern C++17. It organizes code snippets with metadata, tags, and
 languages, persisting them to an atomic, file-locked JSON repository.
